---
// src/pages/disclaimer.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal Disclaimer & Non-Affiliation Declaration"
  description="Official non-government declaration for RozgarSetu MP. Independent public advisory and deterministic job eligibility engine."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md shadow-slate-200/40">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 border border-amber-200 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Statutory Declaration
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-['Outfit'] mb-6">
        Legal Disclaimer & Independent Status
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-amber-950 font-medium">
          <strong>Non-Government Entity:</strong> RozgarSetu MP (rozgarsetu.in) is an independently operated educational and career advisory information technology platform. We are NOT associated, affiliated, endorsed, or sponsored by the Government of Madhya Pradesh, the Government of India, or any statutory recruitment authority (including MPESB, MPPSC, High Court of MP, or Vyapam).
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Outfit'] pt-4">
          1. Purpose of the Platform
        </h2>
        <p>
          The sole objective of RozgarSetu MP is to assist Indian job aspirants in understanding and navigating official government recruitment notifications through deterministic, rule-based software. All eligibility rules, age cutoffs, vacancy breakdowns, and dates are synthesized directly from public gazettes and rulebooks published by official recruitment agencies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Outfit'] pt-4">
          2. Mandatory User Verification
        </h2>
        <p>
          While we implement strict data verification standards before publishing information, recruitment notices are subject to addenda, corrigenda, cancellations, or revisions by official authorities at any time. 
          <strong>Users are strictly advised to review the official notification PDF and verify all criteria on official government websites prior to submitting any application form or fee.</strong>
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Outfit'] pt-4">
          3. Direct Official Portals Directory
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board (MPESB / Vyapam):</strong> <a href="https://esb.mp.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">https://esb.mp.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC):</strong> <a href="https://mppsc.mp.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">https://mppsc.mp.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>High Court of Madhya Pradesh (MPHC):</strong> <a href="https://mphc.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">https://mphc.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>MP Online Application Portal:</strong> <a href="https://mponline.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">https://mponline.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>MP Employment Exchange Portal (Rojgar Panjiyan):</strong> <a href="https://mprojgar.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">https://mprojgar.gov.in</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-['Outfit'] pt-4">
          4. Zero Financial Transactions
        </h2>
        <p>
          RozgarSetu MP does not charge any application fee, registration fee, or commission from candidates. We never collect payment card information. All fee payments are made directly by candidates on the official government portals (such as MPOnline).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
